      "text": " you're crazy. Not because something's wrong with it, but because it was simply out of my imagination."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:31.433",
      "start": "00:00:26.000",
      "text": " Now I had the chance to explore Pakistan's roads, which couldn't be more adventurous."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:34.300",
      "start": "00:00:31.433",
      "text": " That's Sana, Alina, Nias and Verena."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:35.500",
      "start": "00:00:34.867",
      "text": " Wait what?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:38.700",
      "start": "00:00:35.500",
      "text": " The sad ending of our trip together."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:40.533",
      "start": "00:00:38.700",
      "text": " Best of me wants us to be together."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:41.733",
      "start": "00:00:40.533",
      "text": " We will be together."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:49.433",
      "start": "00:00:45.900",
      "text": " They just invite us to the most amazing places in Pakistan."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:53.833",
      "start": "00:00:50.133",
      "text": " Show us the most amazing, like, super places."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:57.267",
      "start": "00:00:56.000",
      "text": " So where are we right now?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:04.533",
      "start": "00:00:58.067",
      "text": " We are now entering into the Swat district and this place is called Taktaram."
    },
    {
