      "text": " Wow."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:29.600",
      "start": "00:01:27.033",
      "text": " Also we farm some onions."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:34.000",
      "start": "00:01:31.033",
      "text": " We almost farm here every time for food you're able to."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:36.867",
      "start": "00:01:34.467",
      "text": " You're all doing it by yourself and..."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:39.833",
      "start": "00:01:36.867",
      "text": " Yeah, yeah, we're doing all these ourselves."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:39.900",
      "start": "00:01:39.833",
      "text": " Wow."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:43.833",
